/E (Limited IT Expertise: Smaller logistics firms or local agencies may not have a dedicated IT security team or data scientists. They need solutions that are manageable by existing staff and provide out-of-the-box functionality. There is a challenge of adopting new tech without overburdening the team or requiring rare skill sets. So, the solution must be relatively simple to deploy and use, with maybe a phased approach to learning.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [8]
>>
