/T (To illustrate the data flow: consider an inbound shipment arriving at a Jakarta warehouse. As each pallet is scanned by an RFID gate, the Edge node immediately logs it, checks against the expected list from central, and perhaps uses a local rule to decide where to slot it. The central app is updated and knows those goods have arrived. A BPMN workflow might then alert the inventory supervisor or even trigger an automatic invoice for storage. )
/E (To illustrate the data flow: consider an inbound shipment arriving at a Jakarta warehouse. As each pallet is scanned by an RFID gate, the Edge node immediately logs it, checks against the expected list from central, and perhaps uses a local rule to decide where to slot it. The central app is updated and knows those goods have arrived. A BPMN workflow might then alert the inventory supervisor or even trigger an automatic invoice for storage. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [13 14]
