690 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1480 0 R
/E (- The challenge is to weave this seamlessly such that users of the platform \(logistics companies, agencies\) can contribute data or run queries in a shared environment without worrying about confidentiality. A specific use-case example: suppose multiple competitors want to jointly train an AI model to predict traffic or demand, without revealing their proprietary data to each other. Confidential multi-party computation is needed. The technical challenge is significant: to allow an AI training job to run across datasets from Company A, B, C such that the raw data stays encrypted and only the model parameters are learned \(and maybe those are also shared carefully\). This is cutting-edge in AI \(federated learning, homomorphic encryption aspects\). Achieving this practically, and at speed, is a challenge our solution tackles with NQRust Enclaves and allied tech, but it's at the frontier of IT.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
