/T (Qualitatively, the business also gains intangible but crucial benefits: enhanced brand reputation as a modern, reliable logistics provider \(helping win new contracts\), and empowered employees \(staff are less burdened by mundane tasks and can focus on exceptions and value-added work, which improves morale and reduces turnover\). For government users, the solution builds public trust \(citizens experience more reliable services, less corruption, more open data\), aligning with broader governmental KPIs like the ease of doing business or logistics performance index improvement.)
